<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 184 days of 1997:</p>
<p>---------------------------1997------1996----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,855.....7,788......0.9</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,470.....3,421......1.4</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............836.......874.....-4.3</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,580.....1,565......1.0</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,666.....4,538......2.8</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,407....18,186......1.2</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,440.....6,487.....-0.7</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,798.....7,427......5.0</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,276....14,071......1.5</p>
</text>
